      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sprang up in 1859 when the Hamilton Corporation used the site as a shipping port for iron ore, making it a key Upper Peninsula trade hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
