      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gladstone%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 1911 train depot built by the Soo Line Railroad at Saunder's Point turned Gladstone into a bustling rail hub, serving lumber, coal, copper, and iron ore.",
